      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Social Media Content Scheduler\nPublishes the posts you write in a Google Sheet at the time you choose, to Facebook, Instagram and LinkedIn (X optional), and writes the result back.\n1. Fill in **Settings**. 2. Make a sheet with a **Schedule** tab (`schedule-sheet.csv`): one row per post, `status` = scheduled. 3. Connect Google Sheets, Facebook Graph API and LinkedIn; disable networks you do not use. 4. Activate. One post is published per hourly run.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
